127
00:11:22,460 --> 00:11:24,700
I'm going out for a while.
I'll check it later.

128
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:32,840
Hello?

129
00:11:33,500 --> 00:11:35,660
[Ms. Hsieh, I'm calling
from New General Hospital.]

130
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:38,560
