141
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:02,230
I have something to do right now.

142
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:05,180
How about I call you back later?

143
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:06,630
Sorry about that.

144
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:07,950
Thank you. Bye.

145
00:13:05,550 --> 00:13:07,220
Are you a family member?

146
00:13:07,610 --> 00:13:08,450
Yes.

147
00:13:08,540 --> 00:13:10,030
