158
00:14:15,810 --> 00:14:19,110
There's no way. He won't agree to it.

159
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:24,920
Since you can't say it,

160
00:14:25,010 --> 00:14:26,500
I'll say it for you.

161
00:14:26,590 --> 00:14:27,430
That guy showed up

162
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:28,610
