272
00:21:43,940 --> 00:21:44,860
A gift?

273
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:49,220
A very special gift.

274
00:21:50,270 --> 00:21:52,120
But before you open it,

275
00:21:53,350 --> 00:21:56,610
can you close your eyes for a second?

276
00:21:58,850 --> 00:22:00,040
Close my eyes?

277
00:22:01,100 --> 00:22:02,200
That's unnecessary.

278
00:22:03,080 --> 00:22:04,180
I can't see.

279
00:22:05,280 --> 00:22:06,510
Just try it.

280
00:22:09,190 --> 00:22:12,320
Close your eyes, okay?

281
00:22:15,530 --> 00:22:18,210
